<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>{{ title }} · Theory Aide</title>
<meta name="description" content="{{ summary or site.description }}">
<link rel="canonical" href="{{ site.url }}{{ page.url }}">
<meta property="og:title" content="{{ title }} · Theory Aide">
<meta property="og:description" content="{{ summary or site.description }}">
<link rel="icon" href="data:image/svg+xml,<svg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 100 100'><text y='.9em' font-size='90'>🎵</text></svg>">
<style>
  /* Same light palette as the extension panels, so embedded panels and the
     page read as one surface. */
  :root {
    --bg: #f2f0ec; --panel: #e8e6e2; --panel2: #dedbd7; --line: #c8c4bd;
    --text: #1c1c1c; --dim: #666; --accent: #a06800;
    --blue: #1855a0; --green: #2a7a30;
  }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; }
  body {
    background: var(--bg); color: var(--text);
    font: 15px/1.65 system-ui, sans-serif;
  }
  .wrap { max-width: 880px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 28px 24px 48px; }
  .masthead { margin-bottom: 36px; display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 18px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .brand { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.06em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--accent); text-decoration: none; }
  .masthead nav { display: flex; gap: 14px; font-size: 13px; }
  .masthead nav a { color: var(--dim); text-decoration: none; }
  .masthead nav a:hover { color: var(--text); }
  .tag { flex-basis: 100%; color: var(--dim); font-size: 13px; margin-top: 2px; }
  h1 { font-size: 28px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.25; margin-bottom: 14px; }
  .title-link { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 3px solid var(--accent); }
  .title-link:hover { color: var(--accent); }
  h2 { font-size: 19px; font-weight: 650; margin: 30px 0 10px; }
  h3 { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 650; margin: 18px 0 6px; }
  p, li { max-width: 68ch; }
  p { margin-bottom: 12px; }
  ul, ol { margin: 0 0 12px 22px; }
  li { margin-bottom: 4px; }
  a { color: var(--accent); }
  em { font-style: italic; }
  .lede { font-size: 17px; color: #333; }
  .term { border-bottom: 1px dotted currentColor; cursor: help; }

  /* Cards (landing page) */
  .cards { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(230px, 1fr)); gap: 12px; margin: 20px 0; }
  .card {
    display: block; background: var(--panel); border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px; text-decoration: none; color: var(--text);
  }
  .card:hover { border-color: var(--accent); }
  .card h3 { margin: 0 0 6px; color: var(--accent); }
  .card p { margin: 0; font-size: 13px; color: var(--dim); }

  /* Live demo block (concept pages) */
  .demo {
    margin-top: 28px; background: var(--panel);
    border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 8px; padding: 18px;
  }
  .demo-label { font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.05em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--dim); margin-bottom: 10px; }
  #example-picker, .btn-row { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; margin-bottom: 12px; }
  #example-picker button, .btn-row button {
    background: var(--panel2); color: var(--text); border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 5px; padding: 7px 14px; cursor: pointer; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600;
  }
  #example-picker button:hover, .btn-row button:hover { border-color: var(--accent); }
  .btn-row input[type="range"] { flex: 1 1 220px; accent-color: var(--accent); }
  #example-picker button.active, .btn-row button.active { background: var(--accent); border-color: var(--accent); color: #fff; }
  #example-blurb, .demo-blurb { font-size: 14px; color: #333; margin-bottom: 14px; max-width: 72ch; }
  #panel-frame {
    width: 100%; height: 640px; border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 6px; background: #fff; display: block; margin-top: 12px;
  }
  canvas.viz { width: 100%; height: 260px; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 6px; background: #fff; display: block; }
  canvas.viz-tall { height: 340px; }

  /* Dictionary */
  .dict-list { list-style: none; margin: 20px 0; padding: 0; columns: 2; column-gap: 24px; }
  .dict-list li { break-inside: avoid; margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .dict-list a { font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none; }
  .dict-def { display: block; font-size: 13px; color: var(--dim); }
  .backlink { font-size: 13px; }

  /* Articles (encyclopedia pages) */
  .toc {
    display: inline-block; background: var(--panel); border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 8px; padding: 12px 20px 12px 16px; margin: 16px 0 4px;
  }
  .toc-title { font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.05em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--dim); margin-bottom: 6px; }
  .toc ol { margin: 0 0 0 20px; font-size: 13px; }
  .toc li { margin-bottom: 2px; }
  .toc a { text-decoration: none; }
  .see-also ul { list-style: none; margin-left: 0; }
  .see-also a { text-decoration: none; }
  .references ol { font-size: 13px; color: var(--dim); }
  .references li { margin-bottom: 6px; }
  .track-bar {
    font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--accent); margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
  .track-bar.track-2 { color: var(--dim); }
  .spine-nav {
    display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 16px;
    margin-top: 28px; padding-top: 12px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .spine-nav a { text-decoration: none; }
  .mountain {
    margin-top: 26px; background: var(--panel); border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--accent); border-radius: 6px;
    padding: 12px 16px; font-size: 14px; color: #333; max-width: 72ch;
  }
  .article-meta { margin-top: 28px; font-size: 12px; color: var(--dim); }
  .comments-slot { margin-top: 8px; }
  .footer p { margin-bottom: 8px; max-width: none; }

  .footer { margin-top: 40px; padding-top: 16px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); color: var(--dim); font-size: 13px; }
  @media (max-width: 640px) { .dict-list { columns: 1; } }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="wrap">
  <header class="masthead">
    <a class="brand" href="/">Theory Aide</a>
    <nav>
      <a href="/concepts/">Concepts</a>
      <a href="/dictionary/">Dictionary</a>
      <a href="/concepts/math/">The Math</a>
    </nav>
    <div class="tag">Music theory, in plain English, inside your music.</div>
  </header>
  <main>
{{ content | safe }}
  </main>
  <footer class="footer">
    <p>
    Theory Aide is free and open source, a lasting tool for people around the
    world to learn to speak the language of music. The analyses on this site run
    the same engine as the
    <a href="https://github.com/saarsena/theory-aide">Theory Aide extension for Ableton Live</a>;
    the site and the extension can never disagree, because they share one brain.
    </p>
    <p>
    This site was created with the intention of expressing mutual aid. If you
    find it useful and have the means,
    <a href="https://ko-fi.com/fishfvch">toss a coin in my hat here</a>.
    </p>
  </footer>
</div>
</body>
</html>
